(function(){var C=window.__CLIPS||(window.__CLIPS={});var d={"Press Begin when you are ready.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Worked example.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Yes.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. Have another look, or use a hint.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not quite yet. That's fine. You can try again, or move on without an answer.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Choose an answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Type your answer first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Put all of them in order first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort all of them first.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You explored new possibilities.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New idea explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You worked through something difficult.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Challenge explored.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You stayed with the challenge.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Strong persistence.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You tried a different approach when your first idea did not work.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "New strategy discovered.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You kept trying.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Learning continued.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You looked carefully before deciding.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Careful observation.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "My strengths.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Today I am practising noticing strengths in myself and in others.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What is a strength?.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A strength is something you do well, or a good quality you have. Everyone has different strengths.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Strengths help with hard things.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "You can use a strength to help with something you find hard. Zizi finds spelling hard, but she is good at drawing. She draws a picture for each spelling word.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Noticing strengths in others.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "When we notice and appreciate other people's strengths, we can work well together.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Ayanda is very patient. How could this help him in a group project?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Being patient means staying calm and waiting without getting upset.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "In a group, people work at different speeds.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Ayanda could help a group member who is slower, calmly and without rushing them.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Sort these into things people do well and good qualities.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A quality describes what a person is like.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Things people do well are activities.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Kind, honest and patient describe a person.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Drawing, building and singing are things people do well. Kind, honest and patient are good qualities.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Zizi is good at drawing but finds spelling hard. What is a good way for her to use her strength?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Draw pictures to help her remember words": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Stop doing spelling": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Only draw all day": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Copy a friend's spelling": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Her strength can help with the hard thing.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Pictures can help us remember.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which answer uses drawing to help with spelling?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Zizi uses her drawing to help her remember spelling words.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Thabo's team lost a soccer match. What could help him learn from it?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Think about what to practise next time": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Never play again": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Blame the referee": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Shout at his team": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A less successful experience can still teach us something.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What can Thabo do to improve?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which answer looks forward to next time?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Thinking about what to practise turns a loss into learning.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Your classmate builds an amazing model. What is a respectful thing to say?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"You're really good at building. How did you do it?\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"Mine is better.\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "\"That's nothing special.\"": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Say nothing and look away": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Respect means noticing and valuing someone.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which answer names their strength?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A question shows you are interested.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Naming someone's strength and showing interest is respectful and kind.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Which sentence is TRUE?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Everyone has strengths, and they can be different": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Only clever people have strengths": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Strengths can never change": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Strengths are only about sport": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Think about your family and friends.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Do they all do the same things well?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Strengths can be skills or good qualities, and they grow with practice.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Everyone has strengths. They are different for each person and can grow with practice.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Choose one strength you have. There is no wrong answer.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "I am kind": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "I am good at making things": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "I am a good listener": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "I keep trying": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Think about what you enjoy.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "What do other people say you do well?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Any choice is right.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "That is a real strength. You can use it to help with things that feel hard.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "How did it feel to think about strengths?": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Good": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "A bit hard": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "I learnt something": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Not sure": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Knowing your strengths helps you learn in your own way.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Strength. something you do well, or a good quality you have.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Quality. what a person is like, such as kind or honest.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,", "Patient. able to wait calmly.": "data:audio/mpeg;base64,"};for(var k in d)C[k]=d[k];})();
